{"5002290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Survivor Files - 571", "steam_appid": 5002290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5117170], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivor Files</strong> is an episodic horror series where every story is based on real-life events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Episode 1: 571</strong><br>In October 1972, a flight from Uruguay carrying a rugby team crashed deep in the Andes Mountains. You play as one of the survivors. You are lost, freezing, and far away from any help. To stay alive, you must work with the other survivors and make difficult choices that will change the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002290/extras/f6a8610c6a079e8b5ce49d95f9820aee.avif?t=1788265590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5002290/extras_big/f6a8610c6a079e8b5ce49d95f9820aee.avif?t=1788265590 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the Cold</strong><br>The mountains are your biggest enemy. You must find shelter inside the broken plane, gather luggage for supplies, and find a way to get clean water. Every day the temperature drops, and every decision you make could be the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grounded Horror</strong><br>There are no ghosts or monsters here—only the real terror of being alone in the wild. But you are not the only thing moving in the dark. Local predators are hungry, and the wreckage won't keep them out forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt